
/* The javac 21 program t178_gzip.teyru is the same program as. Its output is
   t178_gzip.expected, and TEYRU_GZ is the stream the Teyru compressor wrote:
   the point of the pair is that this program inflates Teyru's gzip and the
   Teyru program inflates this one's. */

